足りない情報はお任せしたい気持ちでもあります！\n以上、よろしくお願いします！", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": []}, "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": 1785226295.710184}], "voice": [{"amount": 2500, "recorded_at": 1785226295.710184}], "video": [{"amount": 16000, "recorded_at": 1785226295.710184}]}, "custom": {}}